  "role": "Missile Boat",
  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>ComStar organized its military forces around a combined-arms doctrine that valued infantry as an essential element of the Level I through Level VI command structure, with conventional platoons serving alongside BattleMechs, armor, and aerospace assets at every echelon. Manning Arrow IV artillery systems that fire guided munitions capable of precision strikes at extreme range, these crews provide the most accurate indirect fire available to conventional infantry formations, able to place rounds on specific targets rather than simply saturating an area.</p>"
